        "collapsible_tab_kBfjnj": {
          "type": "collapsible_tab",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Features",
            "icon": "star",
            "content": "<ul><li>Front and back hardcover</li><li>Printed on FSC certified paper</li><li>Cover: 195x235mm</li><li>Pages: 176x230mm</li><li>100gsm paper</li><li>All pages inside the planner are black and white</li><li>One light pink ribbon bookmark</li><li>White ring wire binding</li><li>Thickness of planner and size of coil will vary depending on how many pages you select</li></ul>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_tab_abKUVB": {
          "type": "collapsible_tab",
          "disabled": true,
          "settings": {
            "heading": "How To Build Your Perfect Planner",
            "icon": "clipboard",
            "content": "<p>Watch video tutorial <a href=\"https://youtu.be/dV8f4VCo_YI?si=ZKyjIeeKZd5Y5iad\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"How To Build Your Perfect Planner\">here</a></p><ol><li>Click \"Start Building Planner\"</li><li>Set your date range</li><li>Choose the layout you’d like your planner to have by clicking the circle in the top right corner</li><li>Select all your extra pages by clicking  the + button to increase the quantity</li><li>Check the preview to make sure it’s looking how you wish</li><li>Add to cart!</li></ol><p>While this custom feature is the exact reason Your Perfect<br/>Planner exists, the process is quite complex. If you’re confused about<br/>something or have a question, please don’t hesitate to contact us, we’d be happy to help. </p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_tab_wGRA8J": {
          "type": "collapsible_tab",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "30-Day Money Back Guarantee",
            "icon": "check_mark",
            "content": "<p>Your brain wasn’t meant to hold everything.</p><p>Use your planner for 30 days.<br/>If you don’t feel less stressed, less overwhelmed and more in control, we’ll<br/>give you your money back. Applies to first time purchases only, see full policy<br/><a href=\"/pages/30-day-money-back-guarantee\" title=\"30-Day Money Back Guarantee\">here</a>.<br/><br/><br/><br/></p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_tab_xncNx9": {
          "type": "collapsible_tab",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Shipping",
            "icon": "box",
            "content": "<p>We offer standard shipping from $7.95 and express from<br/>$11.95 within Australia. Prices will increase based on the weight of your order.</p><p>Click and collect is also available for free. Pick up location is at Tumbi Umbi NSW 2261. Orders must be picked up within 14 days from when it's ready.</p><p>See our full shipping policy <a href=\"/policies/shipping-policy\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Shipping Policy\">here</a></p><p><strong>Turnaround Time</strong></p><p>Please allow 2-14 business days for your order to be shipped. </p><p>Due to our planners being custom made to order, it takes much longer to fulfil orders compared to a stocked product, but we work very hard to get them out within 14 days. If you've ordered during a busy sale period, please allow some extra time.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_tab_kVWFdY": {
          "type": "collapsible_tab",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "FAQ",
            "icon": "question_mark",
            "content": "<p>Click <a href=\"/pages/contact\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Contact\">here</a> to view our FAQ page</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_tab_NHbTAB": {
          "type": "collapsible_tab",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Buying a Gift?",
            "icon": "heart",
            "content": "<p>If you're not sure what the recipient would like in their planner, give them the gift of choice with a gift card and allow them to build their own planner. Find gift cards <a href=\"/products/your-perfect-planner-gift-card\" title=\"Your Perfect Planner Gift Card\">here</a></p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_tab_btKwBj": {
          "type": "collapsible_tab",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Add Ons/Accessories",
            "icon": "return",
            "content": "<p>Shop Accessories <a href=\"/collections/accessories\" title=\"Accessories\">here</a></p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_tab_GzPWwx": {
          "type": "collapsible_tab",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Note from the Founder",
            "icon": "chat_bubble",
            "content": "<p>I love using the Weekly Planner to view my whole week across the spread. I use the checkbox on the side or bottom (depending on what layout you choose) to plan my meals and write important notes.</p><p>I also have a Daily Planner to write out exactly what I'm doing in the morning of each day such as my to-do list, meetings, appointments etc.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_tab_BWrTKe": {
          "type": "collapsible_tab",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Pricing",
            "icon": "price_tag",
            "content": "<p>The price of your planner depends on how many pages it contains. There's a fixed price of $25 then it will increase based on your page choices.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
